<div class="page-prose"><h1>About PHP Hub</h1>
<p>PHP Hub is run by a full-stack PHP, Laravel and Node developer based in Mohali, India, with 6 years of experience.</p>
<h2>What PHP Hub does</h2>
<p>The aim is simple: explain PHP and WordPress security issues in plain language, say clearly who is affected and what to do, and link to the original sources so you can check the facts yourself. Alongside the briefs there are lessons and articles for PHP and Laravel developers.</p>
<h2>How briefs are written</h2>
<ul><li>Every brief links to its primary sources (vendor advisories, php.net, CISA, researchers).</li><li>Severity and exploitation status are shown only when a source states them.</li><li>Unverified claims are labelled as such.</li></ul>
<h2>Work together</h2>
<p>Hands-on help with security audits, malware cleanup and PHP, Laravel or WordPress upgrades is available for sites you own or are authorized to manage. See <a href="/services">services</a> or <a href="/contact">get in touch</a>.</p></div></Base>
